Mind Machine native core

SQLite / FTS5
https://sqlite.org/fts5.html
https://sqlite.org/copyright.html
SQLite is in the public domain. The native core links the SQLite implementation
provided by Apple's operating systems; no third-party SQLite source is vendored.
The FTS5 BM25, prefix and highlighting implementations are supplied by SQLite.

Apple sample-cloudkit-sync-engine (API reference only)
https://github.com/apple/sample-cloudkit-sync-engine
The CKSyncEngine delegate/event and batching API usage was checked against Apple's
sample. No sample source was copied. Mind Machine's revision/encryption/store,
account isolation and key setup implementation is project-authored.

MiniSearch 7.1.0 (MIT) remains an isolated, non-shipping comparison benchmark.
No MiniSearch JavaScript or Obsidian GPL plugin code is included in the product.
